  "id": "section-720",
  "title": "观看北京京剧一团演出的革命现代京剧《沙家浜》的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-100.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>100)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　要突出武装斗争，强调武装的革命消灭武装的反革命，戏的结尾要正面打进去。加强军民关系的戏，加强正面人物的音乐形象。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/1-099.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-101.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
